# Chicken Egg from CLUCK!, the hidden chicken quest in Westfall.
# Sources: quests.json (CLUCK!, Alliance races only); items.json (the egg is
# looted from an object, the feed from Farmer Saldean); Forever client
# 1.60.1.70338. The reward is general Era knowledge (not in quests.json).

step CLUCK!
  tip Find a chicken at Farmer Saldean's farm and type /chicken at it until it offers CLUCK!. Buy Special Chicken Feed from Farmer Saldean, go back, /cheer at the same chicken, then hand in the feed. The chicken lays an egg: loot it for your Chicken Egg pet.
  accept 3861 @56.1,30
  buy 11109 npc 233                   -- Special Chicken Feed, from Farmer Saldean
  turnin 3861 @56.1,30
  collect 11110 @56.1,30              -- Loot the Farm Chicken Egg the chicken lays
